etained-FFI seam\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.implementation-plan.md:199:| primitive-profile registry (item 11, UCF §7.11) | §7.7.2 | owner / UCF | U13 |\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.implementation-plan.md:637:**U13 — primitive profiles (item 11, UCF §7.11 blocker 7).** The profile\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.implementation-plan.md:794:| the primitive-profile registry format | UCF §7.5.2/§7.11 | U13 |\ndocs/design/yin.vm.code-as-tuples.implementation-plan.md:819:  drifts and the `\"v2\"` contract revision history UCF §7.11 asked for).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.continuation.md:1118:**DECIDED** (frozen §10 phase 6 gate; UCF §7.11). For every row of the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.continuation.md:2420:**U6 — §7.11 (ACCEPT WITH CHANGES).** In \"Safepoint conformance\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.continuation.md:2429:kernel with its tail-completion seam\". In §7.11.1 \"Safepoint\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.continuation.md:2568:§7.11.1's version-0/1 interoperation rows (`:3051-3057`, `:3095-3096`).\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.continuation.md:2700:| P6 | §8.4; UCF §7.11.1 | entry conditions met; Stage D/E port and remaining host gates distinguished | 7d report is JVM evidence only |\ndocs/design/yin.vm.semantic.continuation.md:2702:| P8 | §4.6, §5.3; UCF §7.11 | canonical kernel and retained backends, documented fragment | owner ruling: kept after phase 8, not widened |\ndocs/design/dao.space.index.as-observer.md:820:Architecture round (`collab/1789289314611-architect-review-index-as-observer-r2.gpt-6-astra.findings.md`, thread `01a099f1-87d6-7811-8a69-b3336b956fac`, resumed after a provider usage-limit failure), on `e101932`; gpt-6-astra confirmed symmetric ignorance, the core boundaries, the dirty-subgraph claim, the refault fix, and the checkpoint/serialization corrections, and requested changes on:\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:3733:The current UCF 7.11.1 safepoint and portable-encoding rows assign the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.linker.dht.md:4311: